	



The demand for data scientists and ML/AI/GenAI engineers keeps growing, but many portfolios still look like “course assignments” rather than systems that show that you can actually ship.

Interviewers usually don’t care that you trained a model. They care that you can build a complete AI product loop:

1-Pick a real use case

2-define success in business + model terms

3-build a reliable pipeline

4-evaluate properly (including failure modes)

5-deploy with monitoring, costs, and safety in mind

6-communicate results like someone who’s worked with stakeholders

This guide walks through a practical blueprint for building industry-level portfolio projects, with a strong focus on AI and Generative AI (LLMs, RAG, evaluation, LLMOps). You can use it for one big flagship project or for a small collection of well-scoped projects.

